doltgres_test_fold	bool	Relation target	error	catalog	the fold reads the target's primary key and its columns' operator classes from the catalog and runs their comparison functions	test/t/050_fold.pl: a fold applies the rows committed below its point and keeps a row whose commit is past it
doltgres_test_free_space	Datum	Relation target, int32 block	error	catalog	it opens the target's storage's state through the backend's repository, which reads the repository's newest manifest	test/t/052_vacuum.pl: a standby's free space entry for a freed block equals the primary's, bytes and offsets, after VACUUM
doltgres_test_base_sizes	Datum	Relation target	error	catalog	it opens the target's storage's state through the backend's repository, which reads the repository's newest manifest	test/t/050_fold.pl: the base's heap bytes and rows after an insert are heap's twin's live tuples'
doltgres_test_index_entries	Datum	Relation target	error	catalog	it opens the index's storage's state through the backend's repository, which reads the repository's newest manifest	test/t/045_btree.pl: an insert writes each btree index's entry into the index's own storage
doltgres_test_held	bool	Relation target, uint64 tid	error	catalog	it opens the target's storage's state through the backend's repository, which reads the repository's newest manifest	test/t/052_vacuum.pl: a standby's replay of a free takes out the row version its own drop kept for the freed tuple id
doltgres_test_index_base	Datum	Relation target	error	catalog	it opens the index's storage's state through the backend's repository and reads its base	test/t/045_btree.pl: an index built over a table's rows holds an entry for each live row
doltgres_test_index_fold	Datum	Relation heap, Relation index	error	catalog	the fold reads the table's primary key from the catalog and opens the index's storage's state through the backend's repository	test/t/045_btree.pl: a fold of an index's storage writes the base a fresh build of the table's rows writes
doltgres_test_collect	Datum		error	catalog	it asks the collector worker and sleeps on a condition variable inside the SQL function's transaction, answering cancel	test/t/056_collect.pl: a base backup started while a marking runs waits for its collection, which changes no list
doltgres_test_disk_space	Datum		error	nocatalog	it reads the volume's sizes through the host and reads no catalog	test/t/056_collect.pl: the data directory's volume reports free bytes below its size
doltgres_test_database_lock	bool	Oid database, bool hold	error	nocatalog	it takes or gives back a session lock on the database's object and reads no catalog	test/t/056_collect.pl: a standby's replay of a move's copy waits for the database's lock before it copies
